# Vue列表页面布局规范

基于 [ruleList.vue](mdc:src/views/passLevel/ruleList.vue) 的标准布局模式，用于创建统一的列表页面结构。

## 页面整体结构

```vue
<template>
  <!-- 说明文案 -->
  <div class="all-use-tips">
    <span class="all-use-tips-title">注：</span>
    <span class="all-use-tips-content">
      <!-- 此文案只是举例,具体文案根据需求变更 -->
      <div style="line-height: 22px;">
        1、数据刷新频率：每天上午9点、下午4点各刷新一次，滚动刷新2个月<br>
        2、数据刷新起始日：2024-01 -01<br>
        3、订单范围：已完成、待发货、待收货、已收货
      </div>
    </span>
  </div>
  <div class="new-wrapper" v-loading="loading">
    <!-- 1. 搜索区域 -->
    <div class="new-header-wrapper" style="margin-bottom: 16px;">
      <div class="new-header-max-width">
        <div class="new-search-wrapper">
          <!-- 搜索表单项 -->
          <div class="new-search-box">
            <div class="new-search-label">搜索字段名</div>
            <el-input
              v-model="searchForm.field"
              :size="$globalSearchConfig.size"
              placeholder="请输入搜索内容" />
          </div>
          <!-- 搜索按钮 -->
          <div class="new-search-but">
            <el-button type="primary" :size="$globalSearchConfig.size" @click="searchClick">查询</el-button>
            <el-button :size="$globalSearchConfig.size" @click="handleReset">重置</el-button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 2. 操作按钮区域 -->
    <div class="btn-line" v-if="operate">
      <el-button type="primary" :size="$globalButtonConfig.size" @click="addClick">新增</el-button>
      <el-button :size="$globalButtonConfig.size" @click="exportClick">导出</el-button>
    </div>

    <!-- 3. 表格区域 -->
    <div class="new-wrapper-table">
      <el-table
        ref="multipleTable"
        v-loading="loading"
        class="first"
        border
        fit
        :data="tableData"
        :header-cell-style="{background:'#2978FF',color:'#fff'}"
        :header-cell-class-name="'festival-theme'"
        :cell-class-name="'table-cellcalss'"
        @selection-change="handleSelectionChange"
        @sort-change="sortChange">
        <!-- 空状态插槽 -->
        <template slot="empty">
          <div class="all-empty-data">
            <img src="@/assets/data/policy-empty.png" class="empty-icon" alt="暂无数据" />
            <div class="all-empty-text">暂无数据</div>
          </div>
        </template>
        <el-table-column type="selection" align="left" width="55" fixed="left" />
        <el-table-column label="字段名" prop="fieldName" align="left" min-width="120" sortable="custom">
          <template slot-scope="scope">
            {{ scope.row.fieldName || '-' }}
          </template>
        </el-table-column>
        <!-- 更多列定义 -->

        <el-table-column label="操作" align="left" min-width="130" fixed="right">
          <template slot-scope="scope">
            <span class="hand all-table-blue-but" @click="editClick(scope.row)">编辑</span>
            <span class="hand all-table-red-but" @click="deleteClick(scope.row)">删除</span>
          </template>
        </el-table-column>
      </el-table>

      <!-- 4. 分页区域 -->
      <el-pagination
        class="right-page"
        background
        :current-page="page"
        :page-sizes="[10, 20, 40, 60, 80, 100]"
        :page-size="rows"
        layout="total, sizes, prev, pager, next, jumper"
        :total="total"
        @size-change="handleSizeChange"
        @current-change="handleCurrentChange" />
    </div>
  </div>
</template>
```

