- 扣罚记录：[PenaltyRecordPanel.vue](mdc:src/views/penaltyManagement/components/PenaltyRecordPanel.vue) 的 `recordExportClick` + [penalty.js](mdc:src/api/penalty.js) 的 `exportPenaltyRecord`
